\textit{Stable Morse obstruction from torsion}: The bundle record includes the Morse-theoretic Arnold branch and a separate Lagrangian Arnold-Givental branch. The paper disproves a Morse or stable Morse fixed-point lower bound only; the other branch is not addressed.

\textit{Stable Morse deficits in dimension twenty-two}: The bundle record includes the Morse-theoretic Arnold branch and a separate Lagrangian Arnold-Givental branch. The paper disproves a Morse or stable Morse fixed-point lower bound only; the other branch is not addressed.

\textit{Sharp cyclic Floer count below stable Morse}: The bundle record includes the Morse-theoretic Arnold branch and a separate Lagrangian Arnold-Givental branch. The paper disproves a Morse or stable Morse fixed-point lower bound only; the other branch is not addressed.

